@baseUrl=http://localhost:3001/api/v1/chatbot

### POST chatbot (single message)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "Hi, what gaming keyboards do you sell?"
}

### POST chatbot (with history)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "Which one is best for competitive gaming?",
    "history": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "parts": [{ "text": "Hi, what gaming keyboards do you sell?" }]
        },
        {
            "role": "model",
            "parts": [{ "text": "We sell mechanical gaming keyboards in a range of switch types and colors!" }]
        }
    ]
}